body: "> Privacy review of the full history is clean.\n\n`README.md#evidence` and PR #1 document privacy tests and aggregate import/export and recall results. The `scripts/identity-gate.ts` checks author identities and added absolute-home paths from its configured baseline. A full tracked-files and raw-history privacy review remains pending.\n\nRecord a sanitized whole-history privacy audit receipt with the reviewed revision, ref and object scope, check categories, counts and disposition. Do not put matched content or real credential values in the receipt. The deliverable is a record of audit scope and results."
